@khorsheed/dsh-basic README · 按你的方式调整：- **去掉某个成员**：在 设置 → 插件 里禁用/卸载，或 `dsh plugin --profile <你的 profile> remove <包名>`——其余照常工作。套件是起点，不是绑定
- **加装**：任何 `@khorsheed/dsh-*` 插件同样复制包名安装
- **更新**：设置 → 插件 里操作，或 `dsh plugin --profile <你的 profile> update` 拉取范围内最新版本

@khorsheed/dsh-basic README · 二、安装单个插件：- **对话框**：设置 → 插件 → 添加插件，填包名（如 `@khorsheed/dsh-whalesong`），按提示启用。
- **命令行**：`dsh plugin --profile <profile> add <包名>`；卸载 `remove`，更新 `update`。

</details>

@khorsheed/dsh-basic README · Install：In DSH, open Plugins → Add plugin, enter this package name, and press Install:

```
@khorsheed/dsh-basic
```

That installs all 12 members below; restart DSH and they're ready. Every member can still be switched on or off on the Plugins page, and you can install any single one on its own — just enter its package name in the same dialog.

@khorsheed/dsh-basic README · message-tools — edit, withdraw, restore：Every user message carries a copy/edit/withdraw action row. Edits replace in place and re-send as a new message; a withdraw is real — the message and everything after it leaves the model's context, folding into an expandable divider with the original text refilled into your draft; one click restores them to the end of the conversation. No official package is touched.

