@khorsheed/dsh-basic README · message-timeline — history at a glance：The official timeline gets costly to navigate in long sessions; I personally prefer locating by user messages — you can scan across many at once instead of scrolling up and down. A floating timeline along the chat's left edge, one row per user message. At rest it is a thin rail out of sight; hover to expand a preview, click to scroll straight to that message. Follows your reading position and pages older history at the top.

