@khorsheed/dsh-basic README · capability-catalog — the capability catalog：A new Tools & Skills entry in settings: every skill and tool in the running instance, each labeled with its registration channel (official built-in / project / user / plugin); a three-column card grid, a detail modal with the full SKILL.md, metadata and credential config, and an add-skill modal that installs from an uploaded zip or a pasted SKILL.md.

